    "Compare two realized continuations with the SAME root person's full selector.\n\nThis evaluator reads already completed replay paths. It is hindsight, not the\nperson's information at decision time or proof that a sacrifice was intentional.\nThe saved replay is valid only for the benchmark's action-independent responses.\n",
    "Single realized paths do not estimate their ex-ante risk or expected utility.",
    "Both paths share the actual root. This does not compare alternative initial actions.",
    "The decision-time person evaluates the complete paths. Later priorities may legitimately differ."
  ]
